    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Level 9 Bastion Facility</em></p><p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Renown 15+ with House Orien<br /><strong>Space:</strong> Cramped<br /><strong>Hirelings:</strong> 1<br /><strong>Order:</strong> Empower</p><p>This helm lets a mobile Bastion built in a lightning rail cart travel. Its hireling is a dragonmarked heir of House Orien.</p><p><strong>Empower: Travel.</strong> The hireling pilots the Bastion to a destination you name, at 30 miles per hour along an existing line of conductor stones, 8 hours a day, for the Bastion turn. It stops early when it arrives or if something stops it. When you issue this order, the DM also rolls on the Bastion Events table as if you had issued the Maintain order.</p><p><em>Source: Eberron: Forge of the Artificer.</em></p>",
